[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SRS017
TITLE: Publish a truth track without issuing a clearance
STATEMENT: >>>
The Tower CSCI shall accept a truth track for an aircraft and shall retain the latest position, velocity, altitude, wake class, and time for that identity. A later publication for the same identity shall replace the earlier one. Publishing a track shall not append an issued clearance. Acceptance is two publications for one aircraft, with the second retained and the issued log unchanged.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The predictive picture sits beside the phase machine. It is not a second clearance log.
<<<
DAL: B
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. Training tracks may exceed that count and do not change the checked envelope.
